Gonioreflectometer-Open-Source (OpenGonio) is licensed in three parts:

  Hardware design files (hardware/, electronics/, bom/, Onshape document)
      CERN-OHL-S-2.0                 LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt
  Software, firmware configuration and tools (software/, firmware/, tools/, scripts/)
      GPL-3.0-or-later               LICENSES/GPL-3.0-only.txt (GPL v3 text)
  Documentation, figures and data (docs/, data/, *.md)
      CC-BY-SA-4.0                   LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt

Vendor CAD is not included; it is linked from bom/master_bom.csv under its owners' terms.
